WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:47.802 --> 01:50.592
The first semester of classes is now over.

01:50.592 --> 01:52.262
Good work, everyone.

01:52.762 --> 01:54.852
As for homework over summer break,

01:54.852 --> 01:58.102
I would like you to finish a children's story.

02:04.692 --> 02:06.322
Reiko-san...

02:06.862 --> 02:08.322
I want to see you...

02:10.952 --> 02:13.112
Everyone.

02:15.202 --> 02:18.492
The due date is the first day of the second semester.

02:18.492 --> 02:20.832
Please don't forget.

02:20.832 --> 02:22.332
Okay?

02:23.922 --> 02:27.302
There's less than a week before the semester starts.

02:27.302 --> 02:29.132
But I still don't have any ideas.

02:29.762 --> 02:31.222
What do I do?

02:32.342 --> 02:38.392
At the End of Summer

02:42.692 --> 02:45.062
I can't come up with any ideas...

02:47.152 --> 02:48.522
Shiratori-kun!

02:48.522 --> 02:50.402
I bought some ice cream.

02:50.902 --> 02:53.282
Do you want to join us and cool down?

02:55.912 --> 02:56.872
What's the matter with you?!

02:56.872 --> 02:59.082
I was inviting you over!

02:59.082 --> 03:03.412
He said he wasn't done with his homework yet.

03:04.082 --> 03:07.042
He should work on it on the last day.

03:07.042 --> 03:09.712
That's how it's supposed to be done.

03:10.712 --> 03:14.342
I can see how you were as a kid.

03:14.342 --> 03:18.392
Asami-chan, don't do what she does.

03:18.392 --> 03:21.312
Or else, you'll grow up into this.

03:21.312 --> 03:23.182
What's that supposed to mean?

03:23.182 --> 03:25.312
And what about you?

03:25.312 --> 03:28.482
Who do you think I am?

03:28.482 --> 03:31.442
I finished long ago.

03:31.442 --> 03:31.942
Right?

03:34.362 --> 03:35.952
Right...

03:36.612 --> 03:39.372
I can't come up with any ideas...

03:40.032 --> 03:42.502
Looks like he's hit a pretty big wall.

03:42.502 --> 03:43.202
All right, then!

03:43.202 --> 03:45.542
Let's drag him out here!

03:45.542 --> 03:47.002
That should clear his mind.

03:47.002 --> 03:47.752
Um...

03:49.292 --> 03:53.012
Shiratori-san is trying to concentrate on his homework,

03:53.012 --> 03:55.592
so let's leave him alone for a while.

04:01.062 --> 04:03.892
Well, if that's how Kozue-chan wants it...

04:03.892 --> 04:04.932
I'm sorry.

04:04.932 --> 04:07.102
Well, Shiratori-kun...

04:07.102 --> 04:12.072
Well, I'll let him go for Kozue-chan's sake.

04:33.002 --> 04:35.632
There's less than a week left...

04:35.632 --> 04:37.682
Isn't it a beautiful day?

04:38.722 --> 04:41.142
Drink a lot.

04:41.142 --> 04:44.142
What are you going to be when you grow up?

04:44.142 --> 04:45.102
A vegetable?

04:45.102 --> 04:46.732
Or a fruit?

04:46.732 --> 04:48.142
Tell me.

04:49.902 --> 04:51.152
It's a secret.

04:52.572 --> 04:54.732
Awww, why?

04:56.282 --> 04:59.112
I'll only tell you.

04:59.112 --> 05:01.282
It's a secret.

05:01.282 --> 05:01.992
Really?

05:02.242 --> 05:04.992
I'm going to be a plum tree.

05:05.372 --> 05:08.332
Oh, I love it!

05:08.332 --> 05:10.962
Would you like more water?

05:10.962 --> 05:12.672
Please.

05:12.672 --> 05:14.092
Here you go.

05:14.632 --> 05:16.962
This is so wonderful.

05:16.962 --> 05:20.012
Also, can I have yokan?

05:20.012 --> 05:21.302
Yokan?

05:22.302 --> 05:24.222
Yokan...

05:24.222 --> 05:28.062
I will grow bigger with yokan.

05:28.062 --> 05:31.602
Yes, I'll be back with some, Sayoko-sa...N!?

05:32.652 --> 05:33.862
Shiratori-san!

05:33.862 --> 05:35.022
You're here!

05:35.522 --> 05:36.442
Sorry.

05:36.442 --> 05:38.282
I heard some voices, so...

05:38.282 --> 05:41.362
I'm sorry for disturbing your homework.

05:41.362 --> 05:44.782
Oh, I thought you were having a conversation with some talking plant.

05:46.492 --> 05:48.952
Talking plant?

05:50.582 --> 05:51.792
That might be good!

05:52.422 --> 05:55.042
Thank you, Kozue-chan, Sayoko-san!

05:55.632 --> 05:56.802
Yes?

05:56.802 --> 05:57.962
All right!

05:58.762 --> 06:00.302
Yokan...

06:02.632 --> 06:03.512
All right!

06:13.522 --> 06:16.522
Good, this will be the main character.

06:16.982 --> 06:20.242
Now, what kind of story should I write?

06:20.242 --> 06:21.652
Onii-chan!

06:21.652 --> 06:23.282
Onii-chan, I'm coming in.

06:24.072 --> 06:29.792
Onii-chan, Kozue Onee-chan wants us all to eat dinner together.

06:29.792 --> 06:31.542
Y-Yeah.

06:35.712 --> 06:37.252
It's somen!

06:37.252 --> 06:38.632
Let's eat!

06:38.632 --> 06:43.932
I made too much, so I thought I'd share.

06:44.762 --> 06:47.722
Are you sure that's all?

06:47.722 --> 06:49.222
Yes, it is.

06:50.772 --> 06:52.732
Is it?

06:54.732 --> 06:59.902
Man, after someone went through all that effort...

06:59.902 --> 07:02.362
No, it's not like that.

07:02.362 --> 07:03.862
That's right.

07:03.862 --> 07:05.912
You're thinking too much.

07:05.912 --> 07:08.032
Don't take it the wrong way.

07:08.032 --> 07:09.122
What?!

07:09.122 --> 07:12.082
I'm thinking about Kozue-chan's feelings...

07:12.082 --> 07:15.372
Then it's best to eat quietly.

07:16.712 --> 07:18.882
My colored noodles!

07:21.132 --> 07:23.922
It'll get mushy if you don't eat quickly.

07:23.922 --> 07:26.932
I was saving them for later!

07:27.142 --> 07:27.222
Yelling at the dinner table is poor manners

07:27.222 --> 07:28.182
It's looking bad!
Yelling at the dinner table is poor manners

07:28.182 --> 07:29.012
Yelling at the dinner table is poor manners
Hurry up and eat this!

07:29.012 --> 07:29.432
Hurry up and eat this!
Give me back the colored noodles!

07:29.432 --> 07:29.932
Give me back the colored noodles!

07:29.932 --> 07:30.432
It feels like we get a better deal when we get the colored noodles, right, Mom?
Give me back the colored noodles!

07:30.432 --> 07:31.522
It feels like we get a better deal when we get the colored noodles, right, Mom?
No way.

07:31.522 --> 07:32.982
It feels like we get a better deal when we get the colored noodles, right, Mom?
The price of the colored noodles will be high!

07:32.982 --> 07:33.522
The price of the colored noodles will be high!

07:33.522 --> 07:37.522
We're still eating - don't bark at the dinner table.

07:49.162 --> 07:50.832
Good job, Momo.

07:50.832 --> 07:52.832
You've done well.

07:52.832 --> 07:54.712
Let me see.

07:55.462 --> 07:55.712
"It"

07:55.712 --> 07:58.462
This certainly is it!
"It"

07:58.462 --> 08:02.422
Now I can get the power of mystery.

08:13.522 --> 08:15.932
She's so cute!

08:20.982 --> 08:23.232
What was that for?

08:23.232 --> 08:25.692
I decided not to dig it up.

08:25.692 --> 08:26.612
Why?

08:26.612 --> 08:28.742
We finally found it.

08:28.742 --> 08:30.702
I changed my mind.

08:30.702 --> 08:35.042
We must not harm such a lovely being.

08:37.002 --> 08:38.752
And it's okay to hurt me?!

08:38.752 --> 08:40.922
Besides, why am I the dog?!

08:40.922 --> 08:42.342
You look good like that!

08:42.712 --> 08:43.422
You're making fun of me!

08:43.422 --> 08:44.842
Piss off!

08:45.342 --> 08:47.342
Oh, yeah?

08:47.342 --> 08:49.842
You want to fight about it?

08:50.222 --> 08:53.062
I knew this day would come.

08:53.062 --> 08:56.062
I accept your challenge.

08:58.692 --> 09:00.272
That won't cut it.

09:11.662 --> 09:14.122
The character is fine.

09:14.122 --> 09:15.202
So, now the story...

09:15.202 --> 09:17.332
Mom, hurry!

09:17.332 --> 09:20.252
The boss will be here any minute!

09:23.962 --> 09:25.172
Where is this?

09:25.172 --> 09:26.382
Where am I?

09:26.382 --> 09:26.882
Where!

09:27.132 --> 09:27.882
Where?

09:27.882 --> 09:29.302
Are you okay?

09:30.762 --> 09:31.842
Where's Asami?

09:32.392 --> 09:34.142
Are you okay, Asami-chan?

09:34.142 --> 09:36.852
I'm fine...

09:44.862 --> 09:47.282
Hurry, Mom!

09:48.612 --> 09:50.862
Once, there was a cardboard box in a field.

09:50.862 --> 09:54.282
An ant and a grasshopper lived in it.

09:54.282 --> 09:55.332
I'm an ant.

09:55.332 --> 09:56.582
Grasshopper...

09:56.952 --> 10:00.372
The hard-working duo was working hard again.

10:00.372 --> 10:01.542
And then...

10:02.922 --> 10:05.792
The ant found the shining it.

10:05.792 --> 10:10.382
You are honest, pure-hearted, and hard working.

10:10.382 --> 10:11.682
You think so?

10:12.932 --> 10:13.932
It looks yummy...

10:15.602 --> 10:17.562
Don't eat it, Grasshopper!

10:17.562 --> 10:19.272
Please stop!

10:19.272 --> 10:23.482
I came to make your wishes come true!

10:25.022 --> 10:26.272
Here you go.

10:26.272 --> 10:30.402
The twice-diluted fine orange juice.

10:30.402 --> 10:33.492
So, about the story earlier...

10:34.072 --> 10:35.782
Oh, yes.

10:35.782 --> 10:38.992
I can make any of your wishes come true.

10:38.992 --> 10:40.502
However, it's limited to three wishes.

10:40.752 --> 10:41.582
Wow!

10:41.582 --> 10:43.792
It really can happen!

10:43.792 --> 10:48.172
It's true that good luck will come if you work hard.

10:48.172 --> 10:49.502
Yeah.

10:50.172 --> 10:52.382
What should I wish for?

10:52.382 --> 10:54.632
I want to eat a lot of yokan.

10:54.632 --> 10:57.012
I want a soft bed.

10:57.392 --> 10:58.352
Yes!

11:01.522 --> 11:03.232
You can't do that!

11:03.232 --> 11:05.652
You have to think more carefully!

11:05.652 --> 11:07.562
One left.

11:08.112 --> 11:09.322
Wait a...

11:12.902 --> 11:15.202
Safe!

11:19.032 --> 11:21.332
Pudding for Ant.

11:21.332 --> 11:22.662
Okay!

11:26.712 --> 11:29.542
All three wishes came true.

11:29.542 --> 11:31.302
Isn't that great?

11:31.302 --> 11:34.092
So, bye-bye.

11:44.312 --> 11:46.022
This is no good.

11:56.532 --> 11:58.282
This is Kojima Parcel.

11:58.282 --> 11:58.782
Yes.

12:07.082 --> 12:08.252
Why am I blushing?

12:10.592 --> 12:11.802
Here it comes!

12:12.132 --> 12:14.092
It's a big one!

12:17.932 --> 12:19.142
Thank you.

12:20.972 --> 12:24.972
I was able to escape the pond because of you.

12:24.972 --> 12:25.772
As a token of my appreciation,

12:26.232 --> 12:31.862
you may have either the Silver Haibara-san, or the Gold Haibara-san.

12:31.862 --> 12:33.442
Which would you like?

12:38.072 --> 12:39.862
I don't want either!

12:54.302 --> 12:57.672
Haibara-san, have you seen Shiratori-san?

12:57.672 --> 12:59.432
Oh, he was here just a minute ago.

12:59.432 --> 13:00.972
Maybe he went back to his room.

13:01.512 --> 13:02.842
Hey, that's...

13:02.842 --> 13:02.892
Pears
Hey, that's...

13:02.892 --> 13:03.432
Pears

13:03.432 --> 13:06.052
It's a package for Shiratori-san.
Pears

13:06.052 --> 13:06.102
It's a package for Shiratori-san.

13:06.102 --> 13:08.602
Do you want me to help you carry it?

13:08.602 --> 13:10.812
I'll be fine.

13:11.982 --> 13:14.822
Good luck, Shiratori-san.

13:22.492 --> 13:23.582
Surprise Garden

13:23.582 --> 13:25.992
So, what are you growing in the garden?
Surprise Garden

13:25.992 --> 13:26.042
So, what are you growing in the garden?

13:26.042 --> 13:29.292
Well, I don't know either.

13:30.082 --> 13:32.042
They're growing.

13:32.462 --> 13:35.302
Keep it up!

13:35.302 --> 13:38.632
Kozue-chan, you always talk to them.

13:38.632 --> 13:39.262
Yeah.

13:39.262 --> 13:41.052
I heard about it once.

13:41.052 --> 13:43.642
"Grow up to be a fine, healthy plant."

13:43.642 --> 13:48.522
If I talk to them, they really will grow up to be fine and healthy.

13:48.522 --> 13:51.692
I've heard that too.

13:51.692 --> 13:56.152
Since they sprouted, I want them to grow up healthy,

13:56.152 --> 13:59.492
and I just hope that they will get my feelings, too.

13:59.492 --> 14:01.362
I'm sure they can.

14:01.362 --> 14:02.532
Do you think so?

14:02.532 --> 14:05.162
I'm sure of it.

14:05.162 --> 14:06.782
Now, Kozue-chan.

14:07.242 --> 14:07.952
Yeah.

14:08.662 --> 14:12.042
Grow up to be a fine, healthy plant.

14:14.922 --> 14:17.342
I think I have an idea...

14:24.642 --> 14:27.722
Good, it's turning out well.

14:28.062 --> 14:29.522
Now...

14:29.522 --> 14:31.732
It should be delicious...

14:32.392 --> 14:33.812
Sayoko-san?

14:38.522 --> 14:40.232
It's from Mom!

14:44.112 --> 14:45.032
Pears!

14:47.742 --> 14:49.332
Just ripe enough.

14:50.542 --> 14:53.082
Yes, they are...

14:53.832 --> 14:56.002
Here, please have some.

14:56.002 --> 14:56.712
Pear.
Thank you, Onii-chan.

14:56.712 --> 14:56.792
Thank you, Onii-chan.

14:56.792 --> 14:57.462
Pear.
Thank you, Onii-chan.

14:57.462 --> 14:57.592
Thank you, Onii-chan.

14:57.592 --> 14:58.502
Pear.
Thank you, Onii-chan.

14:58.802 --> 15:01.512
Please have some, if you'd like.

15:01.512 --> 15:03.802
They look yummy!

15:03.802 --> 15:04.632
Thank you.

15:04.632 --> 15:05.512
No problem.

15:06.142 --> 15:08.512
Please have some, if you'd like.

15:08.512 --> 15:10.432
Thank you.

15:10.432 --> 15:12.022
I'll take some, then.

15:12.022 --> 15:13.692
Go ahead.

15:13.692 --> 15:16.522
You're not looking down today.

15:16.852 --> 15:18.522
Did I look down?

15:19.612 --> 15:21.192
He didn't even realize it.

15:21.192 --> 15:23.192
What do you think, Tama-chan?

15:23.192 --> 15:24.952
There's no cure for it.

15:24.952 --> 15:27.912
Kozue-chan made somen for you,

15:28.202 --> 15:31.162
but you were spaced-out the entire time.

15:31.162 --> 15:33.202
That reminds me, my colored noodles!

15:33.202 --> 15:34.502
It's a thing of the past.

15:34.502 --> 15:37.132
Don't bark about it.

15:40.672 --> 15:41.302
Yes.

15:43.672 --> 15:45.882
Oh, Shiratori-san.

15:45.882 --> 15:46.972
Kozue-chan...

15:49.802 --> 15:52.602
Thank you for leaving me the package.

15:52.602 --> 15:54.182
Here, please have some.

15:54.522 --> 15:56.642
Oh, pears!

15:56.642 --> 15:58.232
They smell good.

15:58.232 --> 15:59.562
Thank you very much.

16:02.362 --> 16:03.692
Well, then.

16:03.692 --> 16:05.492
Shiratori-san,

16:05.492 --> 16:08.242
would you like to eat one with me?

16:10.122 --> 16:10.622
Yes.

16:18.582 --> 16:23.462
I get nervous when I enter a girl's room.

16:25.922 --> 16:26.972
A Buddhist altar?

16:27.682 --> 16:29.182
That's for my father and mother.

16:29.182 --> 16:31.392
They died three years ago.

16:33.102 --> 16:35.022
Is that so...

16:37.142 --> 16:39.652
It's a cute, girly room.

16:40.152 --> 16:41.402
Do you think so?

16:41.402 --> 16:43.022
Yeah.

16:43.822 --> 16:46.782
Like this is really cute!

16:46.782 --> 16:51.242
I can't help but buy one whenever I find a cute plushie.

16:51.242 --> 16:53.202
I see.

16:53.202 --> 16:55.912
That's why you have so many.

16:55.912 --> 16:58.922
But they are all so... cute...

16:59.752 --> 17:00.882
What's this?

17:00.882 --> 17:04.342
It's a doll that Tamami-chan gave me to keep bad karma away.

17:04.342 --> 17:06.422
Isn't it cute?

17:08.552 --> 17:12.642
As long as I have it, it keeps injury and illness away from me.

17:16.522 --> 17:17.932
Isn't it cute?

17:18.392 --> 17:21.692
Yeah, it's cute.

17:23.192 --> 17:25.942
Hey, are those umeboshi?

17:25.942 --> 17:27.282
Yes!

17:27.282 --> 17:29.992
I love umeboshi, so...

17:30.362 --> 17:33.122
There's quite a lot there.

17:33.122 --> 17:34.622
You think so?

17:34.622 --> 17:37.412
They'll be gone within a week.

17:37.412 --> 17:39.792
That quickly?

17:39.792 --> 17:40.712
Yes.

17:41.372 --> 17:43.962
Oh, there are more too.

17:43.962 --> 17:45.752
Give me a minute.

17:45.752 --> 17:46.592
Yeah.

17:49.972 --> 17:50.722
This one.

17:51.092 --> 17:55.722
These are special umeboshi I eat only on the days where something great happened.

17:56.182 --> 18:00.732
Made out of Southern Kishu Plum with honey and less sodium.

18:02.192 --> 18:03.652
That's incredible.

18:05.192 --> 18:08.232
Maybe I can have one today...

18:09.362 --> 18:11.032
Did something special happen today?

18:11.702 --> 18:13.992
Yes, very.

18:13.992 --> 18:15.992
Would you like one too?

18:17.742 --> 18:18.542
Sure.

18:21.962 --> 18:23.542
Let's eat.

18:27.002 --> 18:29.422
Yummy!

18:34.892 --> 18:35.972
Shiratori-san,

18:36.972 --> 18:37.972
um...

18:38.682 --> 18:41.062
are you doing okay with your homework?

18:41.062 --> 18:43.102
Oh, yeah.

18:43.102 --> 18:46.862
I hit a few walls, but the story is coming along,

18:46.862 --> 18:48.322
so I might make it.

18:49.152 --> 18:50.402
Good.

18:51.612 --> 18:54.662
You seemed down,

18:54.662 --> 18:55.742
so...

18:56.532 --> 18:58.782
But it's good to hear.

19:00.742 --> 19:02.872
I'm sorry to make you worry.

19:02.872 --> 19:05.002
Oh, no.

19:05.002 --> 19:10.552
So, may I hear the story you're writing?

19:12.212 --> 19:13.052
Yeah.

19:13.882 --> 19:17.602
It's a mysterious encounter that happened to a man.

19:18.682 --> 19:22.312
The man lived alone in a remote place,

19:22.312 --> 19:24.812
so he wouldn't meet anyone.

19:24.812 --> 19:26.312
Why?

19:26.812 --> 19:31.322
I think he got tired of being betrayed or misunderstood by others.

19:31.942 --> 19:36.322
Rather than living with grief, he would live all by himself.

19:36.702 --> 19:38.662
I see...

19:39.782 --> 19:43.122
But one day, the man found it.

19:44.292 --> 19:47.212
It was neither animal nor plant.

19:47.212 --> 19:48.422
It was a strange being.

19:49.422 --> 19:53.052
The man wondered, "What's this?"

19:54.012 --> 19:56.552
It smiled at the man,

19:57.472 --> 20:00.682
and he decided to raise it.

20:01.762 --> 20:05.772
In the warm sun it smiled warmly.

20:05.772 --> 20:09.062
But caring for it wasn't very easy.

20:09.652 --> 20:12.322
If he forgot to water it, it would get weak.

20:12.982 --> 20:15.572
If he watered it too much, it would get too wet.

20:16.202 --> 20:18.782
If he forgot to let it bask in the sun, it would get depressed.

20:19.322 --> 20:22.032
And if he let it bask too much, it would get burnt.

20:23.042 --> 20:26.912
But he took care of it earnestly.

20:26.912 --> 20:32.882
It acted very happy, so it was fun for the man to take care of it.

20:41.892 --> 20:44.722
So, what happens to it?

20:45.682 --> 20:50.732
One day, without any warning, it disappeared.

20:55.322 --> 20:57.742
Disappeared...

20:58.202 --> 20:58.952
Yeah.

21:01.122 --> 21:01.872
Oh?

21:02.492 --> 21:03.242
Kozue-chan?

21:03.912 --> 21:05.452
Disappeared...

21:06.202 --> 21:07.452
Disappeared...

21:07.912 --> 21:10.462
Kozue-chan, what's the matter?

21:16.922 --> 21:18.512
Um...

21:19.722 --> 21:20.722
Kozue-chan?

21:25.972 --> 21:26.852
Um...

21:32.902 --> 21:33.982
Um...

21:34.772 --> 21:36.112
Kozue-chan?

21:37.402 --> 21:38.112
Uh...

21:43.122 --> 21:43.992
Hey!

21:47.452 --> 21:50.462
Could she be...

21:50.462 --> 21:51.752
Could it be...

22:00.362 --> 22:06.872
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:06.952 --> 22:12.672
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:14.092 --> 22:20.552
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:20.802 --> 22:25.852
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:27.812 --> 22:34.562
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:34.812 --> 22:40.492
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:41.492 --> 22:47.332
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:47.332 --> 22:49.582
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:49.792 --> 22:55.962
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:56.462 --> 23:02.302
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:02.302 --> 23:06.932
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

